{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/platform/bundle_intake_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T04:26:34.220486Z","id":"13732311664e9a6e80bf62a686a8db269bc60748c929dedbc11a78adb7aa6990","body":{"detail":"Mutation: replacing `inner.hasQuery ||` in apps/clax_app/lib/platform/bundle_intake.dart:82 with `false ||` and running `just test-affected` gave //apps/clax_app:platform_bundle_intake_test PASSED (27 tests pass). The list has no clax:get?url= case whose inner URL carries ?x=1, and none with a percent-encoded or non-ASCII host.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":120},"end":{"line":158},"content_hash":"3036f7fc6bce20c6f63af7d2671eafdfc0f64ec31a730c2f17cac0e5f822c14c"},"suggested_fix":"Add get('https://h.example/a/<id>?x=1') and get('https://h.example/a/<id>#f') (encoded) to the refusal list, plus the host cases of the concern on bundle_intake.dart:77-94 once that is settled.","summary":"intake_refuses_other_urls has no inner URL with a query, so dropping inner.hasQuery from artifactOf passes every test","tags":["links","tests","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/platform/bundle_intake_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T04:44:54.577466Z","id":"79b7efa7ba3e002a5480c8f4617f4d3041baad47983cbc33b938db259df60ff0","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:b93c9676a","summary":"intake_refuses_other_urls now has inner URLs with a query (?x=1, a bare ?), a fragment (#top), percent-encoded hosts and non-ASCII hosts. With the line `inner.hasQuery ||` deleted from artifactOf, just test-affected reports intake_refuses_other_urls FAIL (76 pass, 1 fails); restored, it passes.","supersedes":"13732311664e9a6e80bf62a686a8db269bc60748c929dedbc11a78adb7aa6990","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
